  "question": {
    "text": "The slope of the tangent to a curve <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi><mo>:</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> at any point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>)</mo></math> on it is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>9</mn><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>C</mi></math> passes through the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#945;</mi><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>&#945;</mi></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math> then <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>e</mi><mi>&#945;</mi></msup></math> is equal to"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt></mfrac><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mfenced></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>",
      "is_correct": false
